First, we would like to inform everyone entering the venue that wearing a mask is mandatory in the lobby and seating areas, and any shouting during performances must be avoided to prevent the spread of COVID-19.

118
00:50:47,600 --> 00:50:51,800
ぜひ拍手やペンライトなどでの応援をお願いします。
Please show your support with applause and penlights instead!

119
00:50:52,900 --> 00:51:01,300
